<title>FINLAND: Metsaliitto 1996 profit falls to FIM 485 mln.</title>
<headline>Metsaliitto 1996 profit falls to FIM 485 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items			   485 vs  2,212</p>
<p> Net sales					 19,972 vs 17,856</p>
<p> Operating profit				 1,133 vs  2,790</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish forest industry cooperative, the parent of Metsa-Serla Oy, is Metsaliitto-Yhtyma.</p>
